<br><br>
The brake rotor thicknesses are summarized in Table No. 2.  The manual for the wheel brakes stated that the minimum recommended brake rotor thickness was 0.450 inches.  One brake rotor, on the left rear wheel brake, was measured to be below the manufacturer's recommended thickness.
